          "B008"
        ],
        "explicit_supporters": [
          "wahren-herlenius-marie"
        ],
        "synthesis": "This position emphasizes the unusually direct connection from SMN2 splicing correction to disease-modifying treatment for spinal muscular atrophy and a compact two-person attribution. It acknowledges narrower immediate scope and remaining long-term and historical-boundary questions."
      }
    ],
    "areas_of_agreement": [
      "B019 and B029 are exceptionally strong alternatives, with mature evidence of major medical consequence.",
      "B008 is a compelling mechanism-to-therapy achievement with focused proposed attribution.",
      "For each leading therapeutic or preventive candidate, a citation must distinguish the prize-defining discovery from broader development and implementation."
    ],
    "scientific_disputes": [
      "The principal comparative question is whether direct, population-scale prevention of HPV-associated cancers in B019 should take precedence over the broad therapeutic transformation arising from GLP-1 physiology in B029.",
